Appendix C: Requirements Ellicitation Logs
Zero-Shot Prompt
● As a maintenance engineer, what are some requirements you have for a weather app?
○ As a maintenance engineer, I need the weather app to use reliable, well‑documented, and
modular data systems so that I can quickly diagnose issues, apply fixes without breaking other
features, and ensure the app stays accurate and stable during updates.
Few-Shot Prompt
● Now I need you to give the user story from the perspective of a customer. Some examples include "As a
college student, I want to be able to view the weather at a glance so that I can be prepared for my
commute around campus. " or "since the weather where I live often changes without warning, I need a
weather app that shows the most up-to-date weather data so that severe weather does not catch me off
guard"
○ As a busy parent, I want to see the day’s weather at a glance so I can plan school drop‑offs and
outdoor activities without surprises.
○ As a runner, I want hourly forecasts so I can choose the best time for my workout.
○ As a traveler, I need accurate weather for multiple saved locations so I can prepare for trips
ahead of time.
○ As an outdoor worker, I need reliable precipitation and wind forecasts so I can plan my tasks
