6. “Feels Like” Isn’t Accurate Enough: Wind tunnels between buildings make campus feel way
colder than the official temperature. Apps rarely capture microclimates.
7. Poor Multi‑Location Handling: Switching between locations is clunky in many apps.
8. Missing Air Quality & Allergy Info: A lot of students deal with allergies or asthma. Many apps
hide AQI or pollen data behind menus.
